-- Exercise batch cross-referenced against a submitted 136-item list to
-- eliminate duplicates (e.g. "Bulgarian Split Squat" = existing
-- "Rear-Foot-Elevated Split Squat"; "Squat Jump" = existing "Jump Squat";
-- "Cable Chop" = existing "Cable Woodchop"; etc.). These 98 are genuinely
-- new. Written originally under Exercise Science Advisor review, same
-- tagging vocabulary as every prior batch — no new contraindication tags
-- introduced. category column included directly (exists since 0004).

